	(descr "Panasonic EEH-ZA conductive polymer hybrid aluminium electrolytic, SMD V-chip, size code D: can 6.3 mm dia x 5.8 mm, resin base 6.6 x 6.6 mm, 7.8 mm overall terminal span. Fitted part is EEH-ZA1V470P (47 uF 35 V). Pads 3.2 x 1.6 mm on 5.0 mm centres, from the SamacSys pattern for this exact part number and cross-checked against Panasonic datasheet ABA0000C1221: pad inner edge 0.9 mm from centre equals P/2, pad outer edge 4.1 mm clears the 3.9 mm terminal tip by a 0.2 mm fillet, and the base outline equals A,B = 6.6 mm. PIN 1 IS POSITIVE and sits on the chamfered side: the datasheet bottom view puts the + terminal on the side with the two cut corners and the - terminal on the square-cornered side.")
	(tags "capacitor electrolytic polymer hybrid panasonic EEH-ZA ZA 6.3x5.8 polarized")
